ook135 has value 6, unit d, and imageRead true\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The typed part of Table 5.3.1 supplies inside diameters; 6d is recorded as a reading of the image drawing, not a typed-cell transcription.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"note1-text-exists\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \".cache/001888816.pdf p.33 (printed p.28), Table 5.3.1 Note 1: 「片持ちスラブ先端、壁筋の自由端側の先端で90°フック又は135°フックを用いる場合には、余長は4d 以上とする。」\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The note is present in the extractable PDF text.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"note1-is-conditional\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \".cache/001888816.pdf p.33 (printed p.28), Table 5.3.1 Note 1 contains 「用いる場合には」\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The note is conditional on using a 90-degree or 135-degree hook; it does not prescribe that a hook exists at every such location.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"note1-untranscribed\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"docs/ADR.md:546,615-619 records the note; searches of src/rulepack/** and tests/golden/fixtures/spec-r7-ch5.json found no match for the note wording\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The note is documented in ADR-040 context but is absent from the rulepack and spec-r7-ch5 fixture.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"rect-hoop-closed-today\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"src/domain/rebar/column.ts:303-321 constructs rectangular hoops from four points and sets closed: true; src/domain/rebar/girder.ts:732-748 does the same for stirrups; circular hoops use the same closed path\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Rectangular shear bars are four-point closed paths, and circular column hoops are also closed.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"deviation-ledger-matches\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/golden/fixtures/fabrication-length.json:253-260 and :576-583 record missingMm 156, withHookTailMm 2956/2056, and expected 2800/1900; tests/golden/fabrication-length.test.ts:216-228 asserts expected plus missing equals withHookTail\",\r\n      \"note\": \"156mm equals 2 x 6d x 13mm; 2956 = 2800 + 156 and 2056 = 1900 + 156.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"cantilever-rect-single-source\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"src/domain/model/project.ts:1160-1188 contains cantileverSlabRect; PlanEditor.tsx:17,82,236,512 and src/lib/viewer/building.ts:9,80-86 call it; a temporary freeEdge mutation made both PlanEditor.test.tsx and building.test.ts fail, then the original expression was restored\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Plan and 3D have no duplicate rectangle calculation, and the mutation check showed both consumers depend on the shared function.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"tail-direction-unspecified\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \".cache/001888816.pdf p.32-33 (printed p.27-28): 5.3.2(2) lists hook targets and Table 5.3.1 lists angle, inside diameter, and Note 1; neither passage specifies which corner or direction receives the hook\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The source specifies hook applicability and dimensions, but not the corner or orientation of a shear-bar hook.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"verdict\": \"refuted\"\r\n}\r\n{\r\n  \"premises\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"quantity-length-excludes-hook\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \".cache/001178206.pdf p.20 (printed p.15), 1通則2): 「フープ、スタラップの長さは、それぞれ柱、基礎梁、梁及び壁梁のコンクリートの断面の設計寸法による周長を鉄筋の長さとし、フックはないものとする。」; src/domain/rebar/measurement.ts:29-49,61-70 calculates design perimeter plus measure.hoop.length.addition, and src/rulepack/jp-mlit/measure.yaml:5-12 sets that addition to 0; column.ts:208-214,303-323 and girder.ts:718-750 assign those values to Rebar.length.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The premise is limited to design-length calculation. The hook tail is not part of Rebar.length.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"line-id-is-shape-key\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"src/domain/quantity/index.ts:193-201 builds shapeKey by joining rebar.points and returns it in quantityLineId; aggregateQuantity uses that id at :264-306 as QuantityLine.id.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Changing the points changes the returned row id.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"notes-keyed-by-line-id\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"src/domain/model/project.ts:100-108 declares Project.notes as Record<string,string>; :1553-1563 setNote writes by lineId; :1580-1581 serializes with JSON.stringify; :1962-1980 deserializes and validates the Project; src/lib/export/index.ts:405-406 reads project.notes?.[line.id]. Runtime probe: {\\\"idsDiffer\\\":true,\\\"oldNote\\\":\\\"memo\\\",\\\"newIdNote\\\":\\\"\\\"} after changing only points.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The serialized project retains the old note, while the changed QuantityLine.id no longer finds it.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"quantity-ignores-new-field\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"src/domain/quantity/index.ts:193-214 explicitly enumerates the fields used to form quantityLineId and spliceLineId; :167-184 and :250-357 show aggregateQuantity's Rebar reads (ruleHits, memberId, role, size, shape, length, count, formula, splice). No spread or Object.keys participates in key construction. Runtime probe adding __probe='hookTails' returned {\\\"quantityLineIdSame\\\":true,\\\"spliceLineIdSame\\\":true}.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"spliceLineId reads rebar.id only on its missing-splice error path at :211; id is not part of the returned row key.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"viewer-reads-points0-as-cover\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"src/lib/viewer/geometry.ts:163 reads points[0] x/z for column main inset; :237 reads points[0] z for girder main inset; :322 reads points[0] y/z for side-bar placement; :445 reads points[0][2] as wall coverZ; :461 computes slab cover from the maximum z over all points. The path contract is therefore first-point order except for the documented slab maximum-z case.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The listed code uses the first point or the explicitly documented all-points maximum as the cover/face reference.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"polyline-consumers-are-two\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"Production search found the point-path consumers at src/lib/viewer/geometry.ts:714-725 (edge construction, including the closed last-to-first edge) and src/components/viewer/Viewer3D.tsx:1033-1049 (toBayFrame maps the complete polyline before the geometry path is consumed). Other geometry.ts points references at :163,:237,:322,:445,:461,:977 are placement/reference calculations, not a third polyline renderer; no other production .ts/.tsx point-path consumer was found.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The Viewer3D reference is the slab polyline translation path; rendering then consumes geometry.ts segments.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"hook-mandatory-for-shear-bars\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \".cache/001888816.pdf p.32-33 (printed p.27-28), 5.3.2(2): 「次の部分に使用する異形鉄筋の末端部にフックを付ける。」 followed by 「(ｶ) 帯筋、あばら筋及び幅止め筋」.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The standard specification explicitly enumerates all three shear-bar roles in the hook-target list.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"hook135-tail-is-6d\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"src/rulepack/jp-mlit/bend.yaml:221-229 has key bend.hook135, expr 6d, value 6, unit d, source 表5.3.1 折曲げ図 page 27, and image-reading note; tests/golden/fixtures/spec-r7-ch5.json:101-108 records the same entry with pdfPage 33, printedPage 27, imageRead true.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The typed table text exposes inside diameters; this 6d tail is recorded as a reading of the image drawing.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"note1-untranscribed\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"docs/ADR.md:615-624 records 表5.3.1 注1, including 「片持ちスラブ先端、壁筋の自由端側の先端で90°フック又は135°フックを用いる場合には、余長は4d 以上とする」. An exact-wording search over src/rulepack/** and tests/golden/fixtures/spec-r7-ch5.json returned NO_MATCH.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The note is present in ADR-040 but absent from both the rulepack and the spec-r7-ch5 fixture.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"rect-hoop-closed-today\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"src/domain/rebar/column.ts:303-321 constructs rectangular or circular column hoop points and sets closed: true; src/domain/rebar/girder.ts:732-750 constructs stirrup points and sets closed: true.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Both rectangular shear-bar paths and the circular column-hoop path are currently closed.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"deviation-ledger-matches\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/golden/fixtures/fabrication-length.json:253-260 records column missingMm 156, withHookTailMm 2956, expected 2800; :576-583 records girder missingMm 156, withHookTailMm 2056, expected 1900. Direct calculation for both cases gives 2×6×13=156 and expected+missing=withHookTail. tests/golden/fabrication-length.test.ts:216-228 asserts the latter equality.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Both deviation records match the stated 6d-per-end, D13 arithmetic.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"tail-direction-unspecified\",\r\n      \"verdict\": \"upheld\",\r\n      \"evidence\": \".cache/001888816.pdf p.33 (printed p.28), 5.3.2(2)(ｶ) only names 帯筋・あばら筋・幅止め筋 as hook targets; 表5.3.1 lists bend angles/inside diameters and 注1's conditional 4d tail. Neither passage assigns a hook to a corner, side, left/right direction, or face. The page's other 隅 wording belongs to 5.3.2(2)(ｳ) 梁主筋 and does not specify shear-bar hook placement.\",\r\n      \"note\": \"The corner and diagonal-tail placement remain product drawing rules rather than source-specified placement.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"verdict\": \"upheld\"\r\n}\r\n{\r\n  \"step\": 1,\r\n  \"name\": \"hook-tail-domain-golden\",\r\n  \"status\": \"completed\",\r\n  \"summary\": \"Rebar.hookTails를 추가하고 柱 帯筋·大梁 あばら筋의 135°フック余長을 3D 전용 형상으로 분리했다.\",\r\n  \"golden\": {\r\n    \"columnHoop\": {\r\n      \"expectedFabricationLengthMm\": 2956,\r\n      \"derivation\": \"직선부 2800 + bend.hook135 6d × D13 13 = 78mm × 양 끝 2 = 2956mm\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"girderStirrup\": {\r\n      \"expectedFabricationLengthMm\": 2056,\r\n      \"derivation\": \"직선부 1900 + bend.hook135 6d × D13 13 = 78mm × 양 끝 2 = 2056mm\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"circularColumnHoop\": {\r\n      \"expectedHookTailIncrementMm\": 156,\r\n      \"derivation\": \"원형 폴리라인의 절대길이는 다각형 근사이므로, hook tail 증분만 78mm × 양 끝 2로 대조\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"deviation\": {\r\n    \"term\": \"bendRadius\",\r\n    \"status\": \"deviation-from-source\",\r\n    \"narrowed\": \"기존 hook135 누락 대장을 제거하지 않고 bendRadius 미확정 대장으로 좁혔다. missingMm은 제거하고, 余長은 구현됐으며 表5.3.1 折曲げ図가 이미지라 남은 曲げ部の伸び는 수치화하지 않는다고 기록했다.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"regressions\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"design-length-and-count\",\r\n      \"assertion\": \"Rebar.length는 1通則2)의 단면 설계 치수周長과 룰팩 가산, count는 1通則7)의 ceil(partLength/pitch)+룰팩 가산으로 대조한다. bend.hook135는 ruleHits에 없다.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"quantity-line-id\",\r\n      \"assertion\": \"hookTails가 있는 Rebar와 필드를 삭제한 동일 Rebar의 quantityLineId 문자열을 문자 그대로 비교한다.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"project-note-export\",\r\n      \"assertion\": \"hookTails가 생성된 帯筋 행에 setNote한 값이 xlsx WorkbookSpec의 해당 행 備考 셀에 남는지 확인한다.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"mutationChecks\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"mutation\": \"柱 帯筋 length를 hoopLength + distributionAdditionRule.value로 변경\",\r\n      \"command\": \"npx vitest run tests/golden/fabrication-length.test.ts -t \\\"keeps design length and count\\\"\",\r\n      \"result\": \"실패 확인: expected 3200, received 3201\",\r\n      \"restored\": true\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"mutation\": \"quantityLineId의 shapeKey에 hookTails 존재 여부를 추가\",\r\n      \"command\": \"npx vitest run tests/golden/fabrication-length.test.ts -t \\\"byte-for-byte independent\\\"\",\r\n      \"result\": \"실패 확인: hookTails가 있는 ID에 |hook가 추가됨\",\r\n      \"restored\": true\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"mutation\": \"setNote가 lineId가 아닌 lineId|hook를 저장하도록 변경\",\r\n      \"command\": \"npx vitest run tests/golden/fabrication-length.test.ts -t \\\"project note\\\"\",\r\n      \"result\": \"실패 확인: 내보낸 備考가 빈 문자열이 됨\",\r\n      \"restored\": true\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"gates\": {\r\n    \"targetTest\": \"npx vitest run tests/golden/fabrication-length.test.ts — 19 passed\",\r\n    \"test\": \"npm run test — 83 files, 1584 tests passed\",\r\n    \"typecheck\": \"npx tsc --noEmit — passed\",\r\n    \"lint\": \"npm run lint — passed; 기존 route.test.ts의 unused-vars warning 1건만 남음\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
